<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1574267704"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:54.098"><div begin="31.860" end="44.145" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="31.860" end="35.326" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.860" end="33.352">沿着这条小路</span><span begin="33.352" end="35.326">我们两个</span></p><p begin="35.799" end="39.162" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.799" end="37.254">我们走着走着</span><span begin="37.254" end="38.029">天黑</span><span begin="38.029" end="39.162">了</span></p><p begin="39.718" end="44.145" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.718" end="41.101">你的脸上还能</span><span begin="41.101" end="42.840">看到香味</span><span begin="42.840" end="44.145">啊</span></p></div><div begin="47.604" end="1:01.125" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="47.604" end="51.190" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.604" end="49.005">我想对你说句</span><span begin="49.005" end="50.161">抱歉的</span><span begin="50.161" end="51.190">话</span></p><p begin="51.487" end="54.801" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.487" end="53.309">这麼多年跟我受</span><span begin="53.309" end="54.801">苦了</span></p><p begin="55.449" end="1:01.125" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.449" end="56.297">有你有</span><span begin="56.297" end="56.851">我</span><span begin="56.851" end="58.683">就不会再害</span><span begin="58.683" end="1:01.125">怕</span></p></div><div begin="1:02.791" end="1:17.442" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:02.791" end="1:05.510" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.791" end="1:05.510">走</span></p><p begin="1:05.520" end="1:09.337" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.520" end="1:07.088">就我们两</span><span begin="1:07.088" end="1:09.337">个</span></p><p begin="1:10.195" end="1:13.398" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.195" end="1:10.703">一起</span><span begin="1:10.703" end="1:13.398">走</span></p><p begin="1:13.408" end="1:17.442" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.408" end="1:14.427">就我们</span><span 